---
import ContentLayout from '../../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
import ProjectCard from '../../components/projects/ProjectCard.astro';
import { publicProjects } from '../../lib/content';

const projects = await publicProjects();
---
<ContentLayout title="Projects" description="Research projects translating safety, planning, and semantic reasoning into robotic systems.">
  <div class="project-intro"><p>These projects are organized around a simple question: what needs to be true for a robot to act usefully when its environment is only partially understood?</p><p>Project status is explicit. Ongoing and planned work is presented as a direction of research, not as a claim of completed results.</p></div>
  <div class="project-list">{projects.map((project) => <ProjectCard project={project} />)}</div>
</ContentLayout>

<style>
  .project-intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; color: var(--color-muted); }
  .project-intro p { margin: 0; }
  .project-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .project-intro, .project-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
